before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
public class Main {
    static <T extends Number> double asDouble(T value) {
        return value.doubleValue();
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(asDouble(Integer.valueOf(3)));
    }
}

```

